# Binary assets (the vendored RP-1 part models/textures) are plain git blobs, not LFS: RP-1 itself ships
# them in-repo, and GitHub's LFS bandwidth quota would make every clone of a public mod a gamble.
*.png binary
*.tga binary
*.mbm binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.truecolor binary
*.mu binary
*.dds binary
